    32	 *
    33	 *      Verified With: Synopsys Design Compiler
    34	 *
    35	 *      Modeling Assumptions: This library contains a black box description
    36	 *          for a memory element.  At the library level, a
    37	 *          default_max_transition constraint is set to the maximum
    38	 *          characterized input slew.  Each output has a max_capacitance
    39	 *          constraint set to the highest characterized output load.  These two
    40	 *          constraints force Design Compiler to synthesize circuits that
    41	 *          operate within the characterization space.  The user can tighten
    42	 *          these constraints, if desired.  When writing SDF from Design
    43	 *          Compiler, use the version 2.1 option.  This ensures the SDF will
    44	 *          annotate to simulation models provided with this generator.
    45	 *
    46	 *      Modeling Limitations:
    47	 *          Due to limitations of the .lib format, some data reduction was
    48	 *          necessary.  When reducing data, minimum values were chosen for the
    49	 *          fast case corner and maximum values were used for the typical and
    50	 *          best case corners.  It is recommended that critical timing and
    51	 *          setup and hold times be checked at all corners.
    52	 *
    53	 *      Known Bugs: None.
    54	 *
    55	 *      Known Work Arounds: N/A
    56	 *
    57	 */
